# REST Client Requests for Manual UAT
# Supported in: IntelliJ IDEA, VS Code (REST Client), Cursor, and others
# 
# To use: Click the "Send Request" link above each request, or use:
#   IntelliJ: Ctrl+Alt+E (or Cmd+Alt+E on Mac)
#   VS Code:  Ctrl+Alt+R

### Deposit
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bankaccount/1/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 352.01
}

### Withdrawal
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bankaccount/1/withdrawal
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 220.73
}

### Get All BankAccount
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bankaccount

### Get BankAccount by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bankaccount/1

